Bunker mobile icons
===================

Source: Ionicons (https://ionic.io/ionicons), taken from the Ionicons.ttf font that ships inside
@expo/vector-icons 15.1.1 (font build "Ionicons : FontForge 2.0 : 15-12-2023").

Each PNG is a single glyph of that font, rasterized at 128x128 px (white on transparent, 4x supersampled)
so the app can tint it at runtime with the Image `tintColor` style. No glyph was redrawn or edited.

  card.png            card-outline
  check-circle.png    checkmark-circle
  chevron-left.png    chevron-back
  chevron-right.png   chevron-forward
  cloud-done.png      cloud-done-outline
  cloud-download.png  cloud-download-outline
  dice.png            dice-outline
  eye.png             eye-outline
  eye-off.png         eye-off-outline
  fingerprint.png     finger-print
  key.png             key-outline
  lock.png            lock-closed-outline
  minus.png           remove
  note.png            document-text-outline
  pin.png             location-outline
  plus.png            add
  sync.png            sync
  warning.png         warning

